    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go up!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Frenzy Fall, you control a \ud83d\udde1\ufe0f<strong>sword</strong> that must go up. Hold left or right to charge your launch, then release to catapult it at different angles, aiming for the best position to continue your climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509830/extras/99ddf76d08b08f06e71afc144f14e18f.poster.avif?t=1739481920\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509830/extras/99ddf76d08b08f06e71afc144f14e18f.webm?t=1739481920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509830/extras/99ddf76d08b08f06e71afc144f14e18f.mp4?t=1739481920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
